<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Portuguese share basket.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Portuguese share basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants Ltd has issued one million American-style call warrants on a basket of 14 Portuguese shares, lead manager BZW Securities Ltd said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one basket.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    147,000 PTE	     ISSUE PRICE  14,700 PTE</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   02.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	25.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  140,000 PTE</p>
</text>
